WEBVTT

﻿1
00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.040
Compared to last year...

2
00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:35.660
hospital revenue
amounted to 2.5 billion won.

3
00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.010
In September we reached 2.17 billion.

4
00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.320
What about last month?

5
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.420
Revenue for August
amounted to 2.32 billion won.

6
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.600
Well done, great job.

7
00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:54.360
Xi Hospital representative?

8
00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.950
It's me.

9
00:01:58.150 --> 00:01:59.050
Chief Choi.

10
00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:01.400
- Choi Hyungyu.
- Yes.

11
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:04.340
I don't see any results
by JK Bio.

12
00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:05.520
Where is the supply of medicines?

13
00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:07.510
Sorry.

14
00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:08.520
Listen.

15
00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.650
Look at their annual income.
What were you doing anyway?

16
00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.350
Why do you need a corporate card?
For use!

17
00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.450
Why don't you use it? Who prohibits?

18
00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.530
I'll try.

19
00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.260
Will you come with me to a meeting with the director?

20
00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.590
Yes.

21
00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:27.180
Find out what the price is
JK Bio made its way there.

22
00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.210
Are you even leaving here?

23
00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.280
Sit like you've been plastered here!

24
00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.050
Don't you have gasoline in your cars?

25
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.450
Should I be the only one doing sales?

26
00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.820
- Chief Kim.
- Yes.

27
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.767
Do you know what's in Somun Hospital?
Are they expanding the radiology department?

28
00:02:49.847 --> 00:02:50.690
Yes.

29
00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.660
There's an MRI, CT, X-ray... angiograph,
portable equipment - everything is turnkey.

30
00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.660
If we miss this, everyone is dead.

31
00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.480
If these bastards persist,
offer them a kickback.

32
00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.830
- Director Om.
- Yes.

33
00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.480
If boss Kim doesn't close
deal until the end of the month...

34
00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.570
Meet with the director
and reduce the price to 1.5%.

35
00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:11.690
Okay, got it.

36
00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.680
On the way out.

37
00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:18.590
Out! Move, quickly!

38
00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:34.530
Yes, father.

39
00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.180
Euigyeom is coming for the weekend, right?

40
00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:42.350
You know, now children even
On weekends they are busy at school.

41
00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.650
And what?

42
00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:46.960
What?

43
00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:49.760
Is Eugyeom coming for the weekend?

44
00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:53.880
Yes.

45
00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.760
Okay, I'll wait.

46
00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.590
Bring your wife and Uigyeom.

47
00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.600
Yes.

48
00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:03.830
Is Eugyeom adapting well to his new school?

49
00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.090
Oh, yes.

50
00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.710
Euigyeom always does a good job.

51
00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.510
He adapts well.

52
00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:11.370
Hey Kang Yoongi!

53
00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.380
A?

54
00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.520
How many are there?

55
00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:16.540
Whom?

56
00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.920
If I harvest it, how much will be left?

57
00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:22.460
Two!

58
00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.030
And if I beat two more, will it all be over?

59
00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:28.760
Yeah.

60
00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.330
- You crazy bastard!
- Calm down, damn it!

61
00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.900
Don't embarrass me.

62
00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.140
Kill him!

63
00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:42.980
Come here!

64
00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.240
Oh, how painful it is, damn it!

65
00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:08.800
Have you played enough?

66
00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:12.110
If you rushed at the elder,
then he must be punished!

67
00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.160
Like this.

68
00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.470
You take on too much, loser.

69
00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:48.940
Die, die!

70
00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.340
Crap!

71
00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.350
Now it's getting scary, right?

72
00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.490
You should have listened!

73
00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.800
Hey!

74
00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:25.780
Kim Seungjoon.

75
00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.020
Damn Kim Seungjoon!

76
00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.610
Let's assume we're even.

77
00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:39.260
Oh, you scum!

78
00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.090
Let go!

79
00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.830
Holy crap, damn it!

80
00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.220
Are you crazy? Hey, are you crazy?

81
00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.390
Hey, hey, that's enough!

82
00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.660
What are you doing, how shameful, damn it!

83
00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.240
Kim Seungjoon, are you crazy, huh?

84
00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.110
The first-year students became completely insolent.

85
00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.600
Let go! Let go, damn it!

86
00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.610
Stop waving this stick already!

87
00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.350
You're annoying!

88
00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.590
Do you want to see Kim Seungjoon's combo?

89
00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.930
I'll show you!

90
00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:37.880
Great!

91
00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:57.970
And...

92
00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.870
I've never had
someone as senior as you, scum!

93
00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.480
What a bastard...

94
00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.880
Oh, wait, wait, wait!

95
00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.720
Only peace!

96
00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.750
Who are you?

97
00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.890
He won the fight fair and square.

98
00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:33.390
You won't attack him in a crowd, will you?

99
00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:35.860
If respected elders still intervene...

100
00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.990
I won't just stand and watch either.

101
00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.300
What, creature?

102
00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:40.910
So what will you do?

103
00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:44.900
I'll complain to the teacher.

104
00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.570
Or I'll call 112.

105
00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.940
Oh damn, it's crazy.

106
00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.210
Are you okay?

107
00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:53.420
You can be expelled for a group attack.

108
00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.330
So what have you decided?

109
00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.580
I think you should stop there.

110
00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.700
It will be better this way.

111
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.870
Don't need to go to the first aid station?

112
00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.040
Who are the remaining two?

113
00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.490
Third-year students.

114
00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:47.440
Nam Seung Sik, Ho Sung Wook.

115
00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.310
How much time is left before class?

116
00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.480
And what? Are you going now?

117
00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:55.320
Psycho, you just got into a fight.

118
00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:06.160
These are idiots.

119
00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.140
Don't look for me anymore.

120
00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.810
I'm tired of all this.

121
00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.210
What are you talking about?

122
00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:21.410
This is wrong.

123
00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.180
Play for yourself now.

124
00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.800
Or follow these elders
and get hit in the face.

125
00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:42.100
Kindergarten, I passed.

126
00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.170
Hey Seungjun!

127
00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.380
Hello, hello!

128
00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:43.530
Sunguk, greetings.

129
00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.560
What do you want?

130
00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.500
I need to talk to Seungsik...

131
00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.440
Thank you!

132
00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:58.570
Greetings.

133
00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.640
Hello, senior.

134
00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.150
I...

135
00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.660
I have important information.

136
00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:33.340
Hey, are you okay?

137
00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.140
Are you feeling bad?

138
00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.580
In order.

139
00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.750
It doesn't look like it.

140
00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:42.970
Let's go to the first aid station.

141
00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.040
I'll accompany you.

142
00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.340
No need.

143
00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.520
It's okay, really.

144
00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:48.490
Hey!

145
00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.150
Then...

146
00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.230
what class are you in?

147
00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.000
I'll accompany you.

148
00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:55.630
Thank you.

149
00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:57.630
Nam Seungsik.

150
00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.460
Why didn't you come to the staff room yesterday?

151
00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.140
Have you already had lunch, teacher?

152
00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.480
I was just about to come and visit you,

153
00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.830
but then I met a student,
whose leg hurts.

154
00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:15.020
I'm just seeing my friend off and I'll come right away.

155
00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:17.150
See you later, teacher!

156
00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:18.870
Scoundrel.

157
00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:19.790
Fine.

158
00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:23.760
Let's go, let's go.

159
00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.520
3rd grade?

160
00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.530
Yeah.

161
00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:34.570
We need to help each other
when you study at the same school.

162
00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.140
Thank you.

163
00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:38.940
Wait, stop.

164
00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:43.910
Lend me some money.

165
00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.500
I did a good deed
and I got thirsty

166
00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:48.980
but I have no money at all.

167
00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.720
As you can see, I'm a beggar
I can’t even buy shoes.

168
00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.170
Thank you.

169
00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:09.840
See you, buddy.

170
00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.481
So today we have a knowledge assessment

171
00:15:19.561 --> 00:15:21.520
to prepare for the midterm exam.

172
00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.100
So don't be nervous.

173
00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.400
Yes.

174
00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.920
- Do as always.
- Yes.

175
00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:00.410
So, Kim Eugyeom?

176
00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.420
Eugyeom?

177
00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:02.980
Yes.

178
00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.030
94 points.

179
00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:09.420
You transferred from the senior group, but
you can't take first place in the middle.

180
00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.850
Your father is so worried...

181
00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.870
and you're not trying at all. What's wrong with you?

182
00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.640
Focus.

183
00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.630
- Sona.
- Yes.

184
00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.480
96 points, well done.

185
00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.080
What are you staring at, you moron?

186
00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.780
Stupid nerd.

187
00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.350
That one with headphones.

188
00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.760
Hey Kim Eugyeom.

189
00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:40.800
Buddy!

190
00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.070
Has your leg healed?

191
00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.940
Thanks to you, I got drunk enough.

192
00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.210
Hey.

193
00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.010
I won't hit you, come here.

194
00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:58.550
Let's talk a little.

195
00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.190
Are you one of those two?

196
00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.330
What is he talking about?

197
00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.700
It seems...

198
00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:17.130
he asks
Are you the strongest in our school?

199
00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.610
He expresses himself somehow strangely.

200
00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.680
I heard you are alone
do you understand our guys?

201
00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:33.450
Let's hear why you're doing this.

202
00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:39.660
Shall we talk here?

203
00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:43.930
What?

204
00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.740
Crap.

205
00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:57.940
Hey.

206
00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:02.380
Will you fight with me?
You can't walk home.

207
00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.410
I didn't come to fight.

208
00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:07.780
Relax.

209
00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:12.290
This will take a little time.

210
00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:13.990
Let's talk.

211
00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:20.830
Kim Eugyom.

212
00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:23.000
It's late, let's go.

213
00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.800
Brought dad.

214
00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.050
Kim Eugyom.

215
00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.420
Take off your headphones.

216
00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:53.330
Who were those guys?

217
00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:55.260
Friends?

218
00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:57.630
No.

219
00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.370
Just said hello
because from the same school.

220
00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.510
They looked scary.

221
00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:07.280
Kim Eugyom.

222
00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.250
- Yes.
- There are two types of power.

223
00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:15.120
Temporary force and sustainable force.

224
00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.190
One who is intoxicated by time
with strength and importance,

225
00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:23.860
will never be able to
get sustainable strength.

226
00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:25.260
You

227
00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.630
must have lasting strength.

228
00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:30.970
Understood?

229
00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:33.470
Yes.

230
00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.570
Dad, where are we going now?

231
00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:40.910
Let's order you a suit.

232
00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:55.160
Ah, this week is the day
birth of the professor.

233
00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.950
Exactly.

234
00:19:57.030 --> 00:20:01.440
I remember that at this time
It always started to get colder.

235
00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:04.170
Yes.

236
00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.800
So I want him to be neatly dressed.

237
00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.270
That's why I called you
at this hour, Chief Moon.

238
00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:14.000
Because of us, you can't even go home.

239
00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.310
Oh, no need for thanks.

240
00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:18.970
If this concerns the affairs of the professor,

241
00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:21.450
I have to get out of bed and help.

242
00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.990
My family got a lot from the professor.

243
00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.920
I hope he is in good health?

244
00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.330
Certainly.

245
00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:32.980
Healthier than me.

246
00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.480
No, what are you saying?

247
00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:37.730
Director, you need to be healthier.

248
00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.240
Let's.

249
00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:42.970
Like this.

250
00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:46.780
You've grown a lot

251
00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:49.010
and my shoulders became stronger.

252
00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:50.980
Now you're all grown up.

253
00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.150
If I see you on the street, I won't recognize you.

254
00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:58.550
I heard your eldest son
entered medical school at Somun.

255
00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.960
Is everything fine with him?

256
00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.200
Of course.

257
00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:13.040
He's fine.

258
00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:39.060
I want to go to school as soon as possible.

259
00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.100
When I go to school

260
00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:45.400
there will be a lot of interesting things there.

261
00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.840
What? Nam Seungsik came to the academy?

262
00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:03.170
Yes, but he didn't seem like he was going to fight.

263
00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.810
Then what?

264
00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:06.560
Did he come to look at your face?

265
00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:08.910
It doesn't take much to fight.

266
00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.910
As soon as the fists begin to climb,
the fight begins.

267
00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:14.120
He didn't look all that tough.

268
00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:17.550
You're not in the best condition, remember?

269
00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:18.990
You fought yesterday too.

270
00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:22.990
Avoid fights while you're
the body will not recover.

271
00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:26.010
Fight only in the best shape.
This is the base of any warrior.

272
00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:27.340
Clear?

273
00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:39.920
We've arrived.

274
00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:46.300
Let's go to class, there may be teachers here.

275
00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:48.250
If you run away,

276
00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:49.970
everyone in your class will be killed.

277
00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:07.480
What is this?

278
00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.150
Expensive?

279
00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:19.560
Don't worry.

280
00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:24.330
I'm not interested.

281
00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:27.000
Let's go for a walk.

282
00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:30.340
I like you.

283
00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.550
No fights.

284
00:23:38.210 --> 00:23:39.320
Let's just take a walk.

285
00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:41.180
What do you say?

286
00:23:42.380 --> 00:23:43.890
What do you mean, “let’s just take a walk”?

287
00:23:47.390 --> 00:23:48.520
Look at them.

288
00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:52.060
They can't even come in without me.

289
00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:57.100
You don’t want to live just as pitifully, do you?

290
00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:02.240
School can also be a paradise for you.

291
00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:05.270
Everyone will do what you want.

292
00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:10.410
Are you proud of this?

293
00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:13.250
It's nice.

294
00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:14.780
It's a privilege.

295
00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:17.750
If you have strength, you can be free

296
00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:19.760
and dominate.

297
00:24:20.890 --> 00:24:22.560
This is how the world works.

298
00:24:25.290 --> 00:24:27.160
You speak loud words

299
00:24:29.300 --> 00:24:30.400
but you're just a hooligan.

300
00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:42.750
Damn, right on point.

301
00:24:44.880 --> 00:24:45.780
Asshole.

302
00:24:46.350 --> 00:24:47.550
They say you're smart.

303
00:24:48.220 --> 00:24:49.250
Also insightful.

304
00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:51.390
Don't you want to drink?

305
00:24:52.660 --> 00:24:53.560
Back off.

306
00:25:14.310 --> 00:25:15.240
Why don't you drink?

307
00:25:16.250 --> 00:25:17.510
You paid for it.

308
00:25:18.350 --> 00:25:19.220
Drink.

309
00:25:28.520 --> 00:25:29.390
Call.

310
00:25:32.500 --> 00:25:33.430
Went.

311
00:25:44.640 --> 00:25:46.070
Don't forget to sort the garbage.

312
00:25:50.680 --> 00:25:51.610
See you again.

313
00:26:08.930 --> 00:26:09.900
You held up well.

314
00:26:16.240 --> 00:26:17.770
Are you just going to leave him like that?

315
00:26:18.470 --> 00:26:20.440
And what? Beat him up?

316
00:26:21.410 --> 00:26:23.300
It would be fun to hang out with him.

317
00:26:23.380 --> 00:26:25.000
Isn't he crazy?

318
00:26:25.080 --> 00:26:26.450
He has no manners.

319
00:26:27.050 --> 00:26:29.420
If we accept a guy like this,
discipline is over.

320
00:26:29.950 --> 00:26:32.620
We need to teach him a lesson.

321
00:26:33.160 --> 00:26:34.190
Okay, okay.

322
00:26:47.370 --> 00:26:48.670
Happy birthday, father.

323
00:26:49.540 --> 00:26:51.460
Our Eigyeom has arrived.

324
00:26:51.540 --> 00:26:52.430
My grandson.

325
00:26:52.510 --> 00:26:54.180
Happy birthday, grandpa.

326
00:26:54.710 --> 00:26:56.180
Congratulations, father.

327
00:26:56.810 --> 00:26:59.380
Leah prepared this.
Be healthy, father.

328
00:26:59.820 --> 00:27:00.850
Place it in the living room.

329
00:27:02.250 --> 00:27:03.910
Let's go, Eigyom.

330
00:27:03.990 --> 00:27:04.850
Yes.

331
00:27:06.220 --> 00:27:07.290
Hello.

332
00:27:13.230 --> 00:27:15.460
Eat spinach.

333
00:27:16.170 --> 00:27:17.600
You need to eat kimchi too.

334
00:27:18.630 --> 00:27:19.600
Daughter-in-law.

335
00:27:20.040 --> 00:27:24.110
Congratulations on your appointment
Director of Health Policy.

336
00:27:25.170 --> 00:27:27.480
What's wrong with that?
I'm like a black sheep in this family.

337
00:27:28.340 --> 00:27:31.950
Dad doesn't care what his daughter does.

338
00:27:33.080 --> 00:27:35.300
It's good that my brother didn't become a doctor.

339
00:27:35.380 --> 00:27:37.040
This has its advantages.

340
00:27:37.120 --> 00:27:40.680
If my brother became a doctor,
You and I would definitely be black sheep.

341
00:27:40.760 --> 00:27:41.690
Isn't it?

342
00:27:48.200 --> 00:27:50.690
I heard you signed a contract
with Hanjin Hospital?

343
00:27:50.770 --> 00:27:51.630
Yeah.

344
00:27:53.170 --> 00:27:54.070
Father...

345
00:27:55.270 --> 00:27:56.990
helped me with this.

346
00:27:57.070 --> 00:27:59.060
- Director Shim...
- Eigyom, how do you like...

347
00:27:59.140 --> 00:28:00.930
at a new school?

348
00:28:01.010 --> 00:28:02.080
Is it normal there?

349
00:28:03.380 --> 00:28:04.250
Yes.

350
00:28:04.950 --> 00:28:07.980
Compared to Somun,
there the level is much lower.

351
00:28:08.750 --> 00:28:11.410
Why was it necessary to translate it?
at such an important time?

352
00:28:11.490 --> 00:28:13.710
This is still not clear to me.

353
00:28:13.790 --> 00:28:16.520
We decided it would be best for him.

354
00:28:17.560 --> 00:28:19.520
It will be easier for him to get good grades.

355
00:28:19.600 --> 00:28:21.660
He should succeed anyway.

356
00:28:22.500 --> 00:28:25.290
Afraid of competition
that's why they left such a good school

357
00:28:25.370 --> 00:28:28.900
and sent him to a school for scum,
where is it full of hooligans?

358
00:28:31.010 --> 00:28:31.940
Grandfather.

359
00:28:32.810 --> 00:28:34.340
I like my new school.

360
00:28:46.360 --> 00:28:47.320
Father.

361
00:28:48.190 --> 00:28:51.590
Chief Moon asked me to tell you
Happy birthday greetings.

362
00:28:52.090 --> 00:28:53.720
Eugyeom wanted to wear a suit,

363
00:28:53.800 --> 00:28:55.800
that's why we came in
to Chief Moon's store.

364
00:28:57.830 --> 00:28:58.670
Is it true?

365
00:28:59.440 --> 00:29:02.370
That's why Euigyeom's clothes fit well.

366
00:29:03.070 --> 00:29:04.240
Chief Moon

367
00:29:04.970 --> 00:29:09.110
sews clothes that are perfect
fits the figure, without errors.

368
00:29:09.550 --> 00:29:11.500
No more and no less.

369
00:29:11.580 --> 00:29:14.180
He knows his place well.

370
00:29:14.720 --> 00:29:16.940
Does exactly what is needed.

371
00:29:17.020 --> 00:29:20.220
Chief Moon indeed
good person.

372
00:29:32.330 --> 00:29:34.240
One call from me is enough

373
00:29:35.370 --> 00:29:39.340
so that all supply routes
your father's companies were shut down.

374
00:29:40.340 --> 00:29:42.210
Do you know what it's called?

375
00:29:45.380 --> 00:29:46.920
Abuse of power?

376
00:29:57.230 --> 00:29:58.550
Grandfather.

377
00:29:58.630 --> 00:30:00.450
I'm still underage.

378
00:30:00.530 --> 00:30:02.600
You need to learn to drink from adults.

379
00:30:11.370 --> 00:30:13.740
You need to drink from a glass,
which an adult gives you.

380
00:30:55.680 --> 00:30:56.870
Like this.

381
00:30:56.950 --> 00:30:58.020
I'm in charge here.

382
00:31:00.960 --> 00:31:03.760
Your father didn't understand this.

383
00:31:06.260 --> 00:31:07.860
He thought it was cruel.

384
00:31:09.470 --> 00:31:12.330
Convinced that he would go his own way,

385
00:31:13.370 --> 00:31:14.870
but look where he returned.

386
00:31:15.910 --> 00:31:18.570
He could go much higher

387
00:31:19.840 --> 00:31:21.400
but look at him now.

388
00:31:21.480 --> 00:31:25.250
There's nothing he can do
without the help of my grandfather.

389
00:31:27.420 --> 00:31:29.420
Gotta hold on

390
00:31:30.590 --> 00:31:31.690
when you want to run away.

391
00:31:32.960 --> 00:31:37.430
Your father and your brother
couldn't stand this moment.

392
00:31:38.830 --> 00:31:42.730
If you endure, you will become the main one.

393
00:31:45.130 --> 00:31:48.370
Now I only have you left.

394
00:31:49.770 --> 00:31:50.910
Eugyom.

395
00:31:52.880 --> 00:31:54.340
Go back to Seomun school.

396
00:31:55.640 --> 00:31:56.510
What?

397
00:31:57.750 --> 00:32:01.020
All I need to do is call Director Seomun.

398
00:32:02.990 --> 00:32:06.320
A person does not live alone.

399
00:32:06.860 --> 00:32:10.680
No matter how strong the competition,
need to survive there

400
00:32:10.760 --> 00:32:12.830
to rise higher.

401
00:32:13.800 --> 00:32:15.330
What are you missing?

402
00:32:19.800 --> 00:32:22.940
You liked this school.

403
00:32:23.970 --> 00:32:25.510
Your brother went there.

404
00:32:30.380 --> 00:32:31.310
Grandfather.

405
00:32:36.050 --> 00:32:37.650
If I go back there again,

406
00:32:40.290 --> 00:32:41.520
I'll die.

407
00:32:45.790 --> 00:32:46.660
What?

408
00:32:54.600 --> 00:32:55.810
Your father

409
00:32:57.440 --> 00:32:58.910
spoils even you.

410
00:33:00.610 --> 00:33:02.400
What did you do when you returned?

411
00:33:02.480 --> 00:33:04.070
You didn't do anything.

412
00:33:04.150 --> 00:33:06.120
You only did what your father asked.

413
00:33:07.050 --> 00:33:08.050
Humiliating.

414
00:33:10.420 --> 00:33:11.650
We had to survive.

415
00:33:38.550 --> 00:33:39.480
Brother.

416
00:34:06.240 --> 00:34:07.080
Brother.

417
00:34:16.350 --> 00:34:17.290
Brother...

418
00:34:29.570 --> 00:34:30.700
Eugyom!

419
00:34:38.810 --> 00:34:40.080
Eugyom!

420
00:34:43.110 --> 00:34:44.170
Eugyom.

421
00:34:44.250 --> 00:34:45.180
Eugyom.

422
00:34:47.280 --> 00:34:48.370
What's wrong with you?

423
00:34:48.450 --> 00:34:49.470
What's wrong with you?

424
00:34:49.550 --> 00:34:50.990
What's happened?

425
00:34:52.230 --> 00:34:53.700
What's wrong with you?

426
00:35:02.930 --> 00:35:03.900
Father.

427
00:35:04.730 --> 00:35:06.720
Why do you give your child alcohol?

428
00:35:06.800 --> 00:35:08.060
He's a minor.

429
00:35:08.140 --> 00:35:10.260
A man must be strong.

430
00:35:10.340 --> 00:35:12.230
Eugyeom is no longer small.

431
00:35:12.310 --> 00:35:13.760
Father!

432
00:35:13.840 --> 00:35:16.400
Mother and father are both spineless,

433
00:35:16.480 --> 00:35:18.070
They can’t look after their son.

434
00:35:18.150 --> 00:35:19.600
Sugyeom was lost like that too!

435
00:35:19.680 --> 00:35:21.220
Dad.

436
00:35:22.520 --> 00:35:24.670
Watch your words.

437
00:35:24.750 --> 00:35:27.210
Dad, let's go inside, shall we?

438
00:35:27.290 --> 00:35:30.320
I will protect Uigyeom.

439
00:35:33.330 --> 00:35:34.680
Dad...

440
00:35:34.760 --> 00:35:36.590
What a damn idiot.

441
00:35:36.670 --> 00:35:37.790
Do something!

442
00:35:37.870 --> 00:35:39.360
What the house has become!

443
00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:41.000
Dad, that's enough.

444
00:35:56.690 --> 00:35:57.810
Hey.

445
00:35:57.890 --> 00:36:00.690
I said you can’t, you haven’t recovered yet.

446
00:36:01.390 --> 00:36:04.790
This is not the enemy
which can be underestimated.

447
00:36:05.430 --> 00:36:07.300
Shall we wait until the leg heals?

448
00:36:08.400 --> 00:36:09.790
Listen.

449
00:36:09.870 --> 00:36:11.150
What grade is Nam Seung Sik in?

450
00:36:11.230 --> 00:36:12.300
In the fifth.

451
00:36:14.470 --> 00:36:15.870
Wait, wait.

452
00:36:16.310 --> 00:36:17.990
Don't drive, idiot.

453
00:36:18.070 --> 00:36:19.200
It's worse for you.

454
00:36:19.280 --> 00:36:20.210
Move away.

455
00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:22.830
Why are you suddenly acting like this?

456
00:36:22.910 --> 00:36:24.380
Explain yourself.

457
00:36:24.850 --> 00:36:25.780
I'm ashamed.

458
00:36:27.480 --> 00:36:28.570
What?

459
00:36:28.650 --> 00:36:32.360
I'm ashamed to bow down
before people like them.

460
00:36:52.310 --> 00:36:53.400
Hey.

461
00:36:53.480 --> 00:36:54.410
Everyone is leaving.

462
00:36:55.410 --> 00:36:57.350
It would be better if you left.

463
00:37:02.820 --> 00:37:03.990
Kim Eugyom.

464
00:37:05.790 --> 00:37:07.160
Have you changed your mind?

465
00:37:08.290 --> 00:37:09.230
Yeah.

466
00:37:09.730 --> 00:37:12.630
I regretted not drinking that cola.

467
00:37:14.430 --> 00:37:15.300
Is it true?

468
00:37:16.430 --> 00:37:18.030
Here, drink.

469
00:37:21.300 --> 00:37:22.670
It was you who bought it.

470
00:37:24.640 --> 00:37:25.540
Thank you.

471
00:37:26.180 --> 00:37:27.610
For a challenge to a fight.

472
00:37:35.080 --> 00:37:36.850
I was very worried.

473
00:37:37.690 --> 00:37:39.320
I was afraid that you would change your mind.

474
00:37:52.900 --> 00:37:54.100
Are we going to fight here?

475
00:37:56.210 --> 00:37:58.470
Damn, I feel sorry for the cola.

476
00:37:59.710 --> 00:38:00.740
Let's get out of here.

477
00:38:13.420 --> 00:38:14.310
Wow.

478
00:38:14.390 --> 00:38:16.790
You're just a mess in the head, buddy.

479
00:38:17.390 --> 00:38:18.790
Crap.

480
00:38:19.230 --> 00:38:20.760
And you're handsome.

481
00:38:23.470 --> 00:38:25.430
A real psycho.

482
00:38:26.440 --> 00:38:27.840
Hey Nam Seungsik!

483
00:38:31.407 --> 00:38:32.460
Hello teacher!

484
00:38:32.540 --> 00:38:36.400
I told you not to withdraw any more
students from class during a break.

485
00:38:38.680 --> 00:38:41.150
How many times do I tell you this?
Who are you, gangster?

486
00:38:42.690 --> 00:38:43.810
Sorry, teacher.

487
00:38:43.890 --> 00:38:46.160
How many times have I told you not to do this...

488
00:38:46.960 --> 00:38:48.260
And what's wrong with your hair?

489
00:38:49.830 --> 00:38:51.190
What's that on the floor?

490
00:38:51.660 --> 00:38:52.600
Cola?

491
00:38:53.460 --> 00:38:54.800
Yes.

492
00:38:55.330 --> 00:38:57.000
I'll clean everything up.

493
00:38:57.570 --> 00:38:58.730
Sorry!

494
00:39:00.400 --> 00:39:02.270
I'll give you a shoulder massage.

495
00:39:05.980 --> 00:39:08.030
-Are you okay, teacher?
- Hey.

496
00:39:08.110 --> 00:39:09.150
I'm warning you

497
00:39:09.610 --> 00:39:10.650
for the last time.

498
00:39:11.880 --> 00:39:13.280
Thank you very much, teacher!

499
00:39:16.050 --> 00:39:17.090
Who is this?

500
00:39:19.120 --> 00:39:21.240
The younger ones came for advice.

501
00:39:21.320 --> 00:39:22.240
To you?

502
00:39:22.320 --> 00:39:23.160
Yes.

503
00:39:26.060 --> 00:39:28.200
Come on guys.

504
00:39:29.970 --> 00:39:31.630
Go back to your classes

505
00:39:32.100 --> 00:39:34.900
I’ll give you the rest of my life advice later.

506
00:39:43.110 --> 00:39:45.150
Come to the rehearsal room during lunch.

507
00:39:46.350 --> 00:39:47.380
If you run away

508
00:39:48.920 --> 00:39:50.150
I'll kill you.

509
00:40:11.840 --> 00:40:13.740
After all, we have a Korean passion.

510
00:40:14.240 --> 00:40:15.910
Should I ask again?

511
00:40:19.250 --> 00:40:20.150
Kim Eugyom.

512
00:40:20.980 --> 00:40:22.570
I'll ask for the last time.

513
00:40:22.650 --> 00:40:24.680
Shall we be friends?

514
00:40:25.320 --> 00:40:27.120
Or will you die right here?

515
00:40:28.890 --> 00:40:30.160
You can think

516
00:40:31.030 --> 00:40:32.660
until I collect it.

517
00:40:34.700 --> 00:40:35.630
Let's begin.

518
00:40:58.990 --> 00:40:59.890
Ready.

519
00:41:02.530 --> 00:41:03.390
Answer?

520
00:41:05.730 --> 00:41:07.230
Let's finish this quickly.

521
00:41:08.530 --> 00:41:09.670
I need to study.

522
00:41:16.740 --> 00:41:17.740
OK.

523
00:41:19.140 --> 00:41:20.010
Let's go.

524
00:41:32.320 --> 00:41:34.220
Wow, how fast.

525
00:41:53.540 --> 00:41:54.440
Get up.

526
00:42:08.590 --> 00:42:10.630
Do you know what is the scariest thing about jiu-jitsu?

527
00:42:11.390 --> 00:42:13.360
Being at the bottom doesn't mean losing.

528
00:42:18.300 --> 00:42:19.600
Oh, damn.

529
00:42:28.510 --> 00:42:30.510
If you resist, you will get hurt.

530
00:42:31.810 --> 00:42:33.570
- Yes, he’s going to die now!
- Eigyom!

531
00:42:33.650 --> 00:42:36.320
It's kind of boring. It's time to finish.

532
00:42:41.160 --> 00:42:42.090
Eugyom!

533
00:42:43.710 --> 00:42:45.840
Eugyom! Wake up, damn it!

534
00:42:46.700 --> 00:42:48.150
Beg for mercy.

535
00:42:48.230 --> 00:42:49.100
Are you giving up?

536
00:43:10.250 --> 00:43:12.920
Enough, enough!

537
00:43:25.470 --> 00:43:27.100
Hey, is he dead?

538
00:43:27.740 --> 00:43:29.690
His eyes rolled back into his head!

539
00:43:29.770 --> 00:43:32.090
Hey, wake up!

540
00:43:32.170 --> 00:43:33.440
Sleep well.

541
00:43:34.140 --> 00:43:35.580
Now for your school life

542
00:43:36.050 --> 00:43:37.380
I answer.

